" ┏ All keys · [tui.keys] in config.toml changes them · esc closes ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ "
"╭┃                                                                                                                    ┃╮"
"│┃  Everywhere                        Agents list                       Hierarchy                                     ┃│"
"│┃  '               jump to…          h, ←            parent            h, ←            left                          ┃│"
"│┃  -               jump back         j, ↓            next              j, ↓            below                         ┃│"
"│┃  /               filter            k, ↑            previous          k, ↑            above                         ┃│"
"│┃  n               next match        l, →            child             l, →            right                         ┃│"
"│┃  N               previous match    gg, home        first             gg, home        first                         ┃│"
"│┃  m               message           G, end          last              G, end          last                          ┃│"
"│┃  d, ␣gd          diff              ctrl-d, pgdn    half page down    s               subtree                       ┃│"
"│┃  enter, i, a, I  open              ctrl-u, pgup    half page up      +, =            zoom in                       ┃│"
"│┃  z, ␣wm          full screen       s               subtree           _               zoom out                      ┃│"
"│┃  ␣n              messages          +, =            zoom in           0               auto zoom                     ┃│"
"│┃  o, ␣o           open with…        _               zoom out                                                        ┃│"
"│┃  ␣an             new agent         0               auto zoom         Network                                       ┃│"
"│┃  ␣am             new mission                                         h, ←            left                          ┃│"
"│┃  ␣al             new lead          Repositories                      j, ↓            below                         ┃│"
"╰┃  ␣aa             adopt             j, ↓            next              k, ↑            above                         ┃│"
"╭┃  ␣ad             forget            k, ↑            previous          l, →            right                         ┃│"
"│┃  5, ␣ww          wall              h, ←            previous repo     gg, home        first                         ┃│"
"│┃  ␣uC             theme…            l, →            next repo         G, end          last                          ┃│"
"│┃  ␣sk             all keys          gg, home        first             +, =            zoom in                       ┃│"
"│┃  :               commands          G, end          last              _               zoom out                      ┃│"
"│┃  tab             next panel        +, =            zoom in           0               auto zoom                     ┃│"
"│┃  shift-tab       previous panel    _               zoom out                                                        ┃│"
"│┃  ctrl-h          panel left        0               auto zoom         Timeline                                      ┃│"
"│┃  ctrl-j          panel below                                         j, ↓            next lane                     ┃│"
"╰┃  ctrl-k          panel above       Detail and preview                k, ↑            previous lane                 ┃╯"
"╭┃  ctrl-l          panel right       j, ↓            scroll down       h, ←            back in time                  ┃╮"
"│┃  ␣up             preview           k, ↑            scroll up         l, →            forward in time               ┃│"
"│┃  ctrl-→          wider list        ctrl-d, pgdn    half page down    [               previous event                ┃│"
"│┃  ctrl-←          narrower list     ctrl-u, pgup    half page up      ]               next event                    ┃│"
"│┃  ctrl-↑          taller            r               refresh           gg, home        first                         ┃│"
"│┃  ctrl-↓          shorter                                             G, end          last                          ┃│"
"│┃  ␣w=             equal panels      Full screen                       +, =            zoom in                       ┃│"
"│┃  1               tree              k, ↑            scroll up         _               zoom out                      ┃│"
"│┃  2               network           j, ↓            scroll down       0               now                           ┃│"
"│┃  3               repositories      ctrl-u, pgup    half page up                                                    ┃│"
"╰┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ esc to close ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━▼━┛╯"
